{"4746560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Continuous Imperfection", "steam_appid": 4746560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4876200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 levels</strong> to explore and master, including alternative paths and interactive elements: platform triggers, jump pads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>variety of movement options</strong>, focused on speed: running, jumping, sliding, wall running, wall jumping, vaulting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable soundtrack and environments</strong> (summer, autumn, sakura, etc.) to match your current mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time leaderboards</strong> to compete with friends or the world and see who’s the fastest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You know nothing—except that you can go fast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Continuous Imperfection</strong>, a speed-focused parkour and precision-shooting game, you have a full range of movements to learn and master in order to complete levels as quickly as possible. Skillfully exploit your abilities and knowledge of each level to shave time off with every new attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed is good, but it’s not everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your parkour skills, you can use fast projectiles to unlock new areas—some are mandatory, while others offer alternative paths to save time. So yes, go fast, but you’ll also need to learn to aim true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove to this so-called god that you’re not a mistake. Prove to him that you are a continuous perfection.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/c7186ba3ba23451afef61154ecb1c27e.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 levels</strong> to explore and master, including alternative paths and interactive elements: platform triggers, jump pads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>variety of movement options</strong>, focused on speed: running, jumping, sliding, wall running, wall jumping, vaulting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable soundtrack and environments</strong> (summer, autumn, sakura, etc.) to match your current mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time leaderboards</strong> to compete with friends or the world and see who’s the fastest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You know nothing—except that you can go fast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Continuous Imperfection</strong>, a speed-focused parkour and precision-shooting game, you have a full range of movements to learn and master in order to complete levels as quickly as possible. Skillfully exploit your abilities and knowledge of each level to shave time off with every new attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/3b196064a0f6605c5e316250da841512.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed is good, but it’s not everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your parkour skills, you can use fast projectiles to unlock new areas—some are mandatory, while others offer alternative paths to save time. So yes, go fast, but you’ll also need to learn to aim true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.poster.avif?t=1788297040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.webm?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4746560/extras/48d9e14d67cc52082b581e838b155417.mp4?t=1788297040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove to this so-called god that you’re not a mistake. Prove to him that you are a continuous perfection.</p>", "short_description": "Trapped in the world of a god with eugenic ambitions, you must prove yourself by using your parkour skills to navigate and complete a series of levels as quickly as possible. Do not be a continuous imperfection.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite